    "text": "theaustin.org\nwebsite\nAustin\nAustin to Host Free Two-Night Festival Ahead of 2025 MLS All-Star Game\nBy Wade Warren,\n1 hours agoA letter sent this week to the mayor and city council states that Austin will begin the countdown to the 2025 Major League Soccer All-Star Game with two nights of free public events in July. On July 19 and 20, the \"MLS All-Star Soccer Celebration\" will take place at Lady...",
